    {"@type":"Question","name":"Which German brand is cheapest to own?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Generally a well-kept Audi or BMW on a common platform is more affordable than a Porsche or large AMG Mercedes, since parts and complexity scale with performance. Upkeep matters more than badge."}},
